#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "OAuth Client ID Metadata Document"
msgstr "OAuth 客户端 ID 元数据文档"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Use the OAuth Client ID Metadata Document support in the Quarkus OIDC extension to let your application identify itself to authorization servers without prior client registration during the xref:security-oidc-code-flow-authentication.adoc[OpenID Connect authorization code flow]."
msgstr "利用 Quarkus OIDC 扩展中对 OAuth 客户端 ID 元数据文档的支持，使您的应用程序能够在 xref:security-oidc-code-flow-authentication.adoc[OpenID Connect 授权码流程中] ，无需事先进行客户端注册，即可向授权服务器进行身份验证。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The link:https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/draft-ietf-oauth-client-id-metadata-document[OAuth Client ID Metadata Document] specification enables OAuth clients to use an HTTPS URL as their `client_id`.\n"
"That URL points to a JSON document containing the client's metadata, which the authorization server fetches on demand instead of requiring the client to be pre-registered."
msgstr "《 link:https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/draft-ietf-oauth-client-id-metadata-document[OAuth 客户端 ID 元数据文档] 》规范允许 OAuth 客户端使用 HTTPS URL 作为其 `client_id` 。该 URL 指向一个包含客户端元数据的 JSON 文档，授权服务器会按需获取该文档，而无需客户端进行预先注册。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "This is an alternative to xref:security-openid-connect-client-registration.adoc[OpenID Connect dynamic client registration], which requires an explicit registration step with the authorization server."
msgstr "这是 xref:security-openid-connect-client-registration.adoc[OpenID Connect 动态客户端注册] 的一种替代方案，后者需要向授权服务器进行显式注册。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "When a Quarkus application has its `client-id` set to an HTTPS URL, the OIDC extension automatically:"
msgstr "当 Quarkus 应用程序的 `客户端 ID` 设置为一个 HTTPS URL 时，OIDC 扩展会自动："

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Serves a Client ID Metadata Document at the URL path derived from the `client-id`"
msgstr "在由 `client-id` 派生的 URL 路径下提供一个客户端 ID 元数据文档"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Includes the `client_id`, `client_name`, `redirect_uris`, and `token_endpoint_auth_method` in the metadata document"
msgstr "在元数据文档中包含 `client_id` 、 `client_name` 、 `redirect_uris` 和 `token_endpoint_auth_method`"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Validates the configuration at startup"
msgstr "在启动时验证配置"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "This enables a registration-free authorization code flow: the authorization server discovers the client's configuration by fetching the metadata document from the `client-id` URL."
msgstr "这使得无需注册的授权码流程成为可能：授权服务器通过从 `client-id` URL 获取元数据文档，来识别客户端的配置。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Basic setup (public client)"
msgstr "基本设置（公共客户端）"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "To activate Client ID Metadata Document support, set `client-id` to an HTTPS URL and provide a `client-name`:"
msgstr "要启用客户端 ID 元数据文档支持，请将 `client-id` 设置为一个 HTTPS URL，并提供 `client-name` ："

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "With this configuration, Quarkus serves the following JSON document at `https://my-app.example.com/client-id-metadata/my-app`:"
msgstr "通过此配置，Quarkus 会在 `https://my-app.example.com/client-id-metadata/my-app` 提供以下 JSON 文档："

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "The `redirect-path` can be either a relative path (which is made absolute using the `client-id` URL authority) or an absolute HTTPS URL that must share the same authority as the `client-id`."
msgstr "`重定向路径` 可以是相对路径（通过 `client-id` URL 权威机构转换为绝对路径），也可以是绝对 HTTPS URL，该 URL 必须与 `client-id` 具有相同的权威机构。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Confidential client with <code>private_key_jwt</code>"
msgstr "机密客户端，包含 <code>private_key_jwt</code>"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Client ID Metadata Document specification prohibits shared-secret authentication methods (`client_secret_basic`, `client_secret_post`, `client_secret_jwt`).\n"
"To authenticate as a confidential client, use `private_key_jwt` by configuring a private key for signing JWT client assertions and a public key to publish in the metadata document:"
msgstr "《客户端 ID 元数据文档》规范禁止使用共享密钥身份验证方法（ `client_secret_basic` 、 `client_secret_post` 、 `client_secret_jwt` ）。若要以“机密客户端”身份进行身份验证，请使用 `private_key_jwt，` 具体操作是配置一个用于签署 JWT 客户端断言的私钥，以及一个用于在元数据文档中发布的公钥："

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "When both a private key and a public key are configured, the metadata document advertises `token_endpoint_auth_method` as `private_key_jwt` and includes the public key in a `jwks` property:"
msgstr "当同时配置了私钥和公钥时，元数据文档会将 `token_endpoint_auth_method` 设置为 `private_key_jwt` ，并在 `jwks` 属性中包含公钥："

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `public-key-file` property accepts both PEM public keys and PEM certificates.\n"
"The public key can also be provided inline using the `public-key` property."
msgstr "`public-key-file` 属性既支持 PEM 公钥，也支持 PEM 证书。公钥还可以通过 `public-key` 属性以内联方式提供。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Configuration requirements"
msgstr "配置要求"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "The following requirements are validated at startup:"
msgstr "系统启动时会验证以下要求："

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "The `client-id` must be an HTTPS URL with a path component"
msgstr "`client-id` 必须是一个包含路径组件的 HTTPS URL"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "The application type must be `web-app` or `hybrid` (not `service`)"
msgstr "应用程序类型必须是 `Web 应用` 或 `混合应用` （而非 `服务` ）"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "The `client-name` must be set"
msgstr "必须设置客户端 `名称`"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "The `authentication.redirect-path` must be set"
msgstr "必须设置 `authentication.redirect-path`"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "If any of these requirements is not met, a configuration error is reported."
msgstr "如果这些要求中有任何一项未满足，系统将报告配置错误。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Named tenants"
msgstr "指定租户"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Client ID Metadata Document support works with named OIDC tenants.\n"
"Each tenant with an HTTPS URL `client-id` gets its own metadata document endpoint:"
msgstr "客户端 ID 元数据文档支持与已命名的 OIDC 租户配合使用。每个拥有 HTTPS URL `客户端 ID` 的租户都会获得其专属的元数据文档端点："

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Each `client-id` must be unique across all tenants."
msgstr "每个 `client-id` 在所有租户中都必须是唯一的。"

